items/fs-a-connected-space-is-locally-connected.md:82:- **The failure is confined to the segment.** Claim 5 of [[lem-the-oscillating-zigzag-curve]] locates it at the points $(0,t)$, and at every other point $\overline{G}$ agrees locally with $G$, which is locally connected by claim 1 there.
